            "title": "油價低收約1%或以上　連跌3日",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英美期油連續3個交易日低收。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"油價 oil price\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/01/Oil.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"油價 oil price\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/01/Oil.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">油價 oil price</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">倫敦布蘭特期油11月合約收報每桶103.87美元，跌0.9%，本周累跌逾1.2%，結束兩星期升勢。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紐約期油10月合約收報100.3美元，跌約1.6%，但本周累升逾0.2%，連升3星期。</p>\n</div>",
